          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Lea aya ĩvu, na asyaa mwana, na amwĩta syĩtwa yake Leuveni: nũndũ asya, Nĩkwĩthĩwa Yeova nĩwona thĩna wakwa; nũndũ yu mũemewa akambenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
